##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene A quad showing blocks.png, at one sample a pixel and lit by an ambient light alone
version 3.03
Format 64 48 1
PixelSamples 1 1
PixelFilter "box" 1 1
Projection "orthographic"
Clipping 1 100
# the texture is a fixture beside this file
Option "searchpath" "texture" ["data:&"]
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [1]
# with no diffuse and no specular, paintedplastic's colour is the texture's
Surface "paintedplastic" "Kd" [0] "Ks" [0] "texturename" ["blocks.png"]
# 32 pixels square and centred, so each of the image's 2 by 2 texel blocks is 8 pixels
# across. The upper left corner is st (0, 0), which shows the image upright
Polygon "P" [-0.6666667 -0.6666667 5  0.6666667 -0.6666667 5  0.6666667 0.6666667 5  -0.6666667 0.6666667 5]
        "st" [0 1  1 1  1 0  0 0]
WorldEnd
